  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 104.19 Signature",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 104.19 “Signature” means a wet signature, a copy of a wet signature, and an electronic signature, as defined in RSA 294-E:2, VIII. This term also includes the term “signed”.\n\nSource. #13945, eff 4-27-24 (see Revision Note #5 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100)",
